Dialogue: 0,00:02:18.14,00:02:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him to send it over 
to the cargo shed.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:20.87,00:02:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on its way.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:35.79,00:02:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:37.62,00:02:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ferrier. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:39.96,00:02:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you back in four instead of 12. 
I got half of Korea coming in at noon.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:43.50,00:02:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, I can't. 
I'm on a 12-hour blow. Call Tedesco.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:47.13,00:02:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Tedesco can't move 
40 containers in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:50.24,00:02:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta have somebody 
who can do double picks.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:52.64,00:02:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could help you, Sal. 
It's the goddamn union regulations.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:56.21,00:02:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. 
I'm in a position here, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:58.58,00:03:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember 
the union regulations, Sal.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:02.11,00:03:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what your problem is?
Dialogue: 0,00:03:04.28,00:03:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can think of a couple women 
who'd be happy to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:42.96,00:03:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Three and two...</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:04:13.75,00:04:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Steven, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,00:04:15.42,00:04:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's up? 
- Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,00:04:21.39,00:04:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You ever see something like that?
Dialogue: 0,00:04:24.16,00:04:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Springtime, maybe. 
Not this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,00:04:26.87,00:04:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we can see better 
from the back yard.
Dialogue: 0,00:04:51.66,00:04:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta come see this!
Dialogue: 0,00:05:04.97,00:05:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- That is so weird. 
- What?
Dialogue: 0,00:05:08.44,00:05:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind is blowing 
toward the storm.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:10.78,00:05:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That is weird.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:13.11,00:05:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch it!
Dialogue: 0,00:05:16.72,00:05:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel, 
you wanna see something cool?
Dialogue: 0,00:05:52.92,00:05:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:54.82,00:05:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- I wanna go inside. 
- It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:57.12,00:05:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna go inside.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:59.62,00:06:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:03.30,00:06:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough weather for me.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:06.23,00:06:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna go by myself.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:12.10,00:06:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of fun, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:14.74,00:06:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- No. 
- Come on, like the Fourth of July.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:18.04,00:06:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>- No, it's not. 
- O, say can...</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:31.52,00:06:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. You're fine.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:33.43,00:06:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- It hit right behind our house. 
- Yeah, well, it's...
Dialogue: 0,00:06:36.06,00:06:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not gonna hit there again, okay,
Dialogue: 0,00:06:38.03,00:06:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,because lightning doesn't strike 
twice in the same place. Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,00:06:47.47,00:06:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Robbie?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:50.71,00:06:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:53.58,00:06:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Robbie okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:57.72,00:06:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:59.72,00:07:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the thunder?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:02.15,00:07:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't it stop?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:18.07,00:07:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it over?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:34.15,00:07:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:36.56,00:07:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Just... I'm just checking things out. 
Just wait... Wait there.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:40.63,00:07:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are we gonna be okay? 
- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:43.46,00:07:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- You don't know? 
- No, I meant, I just... Just...
Dialogue: 0,00:07:45.66,00:07:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel, please.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:47.50,00:07:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stop asking so many questions. 
Just wait here.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:28.77,00:08:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn everything off.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:31.14,00:08:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is off.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:33.35,00:08:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get one freaking thing 
to turn on.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:38.58,00:08:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You believe this, Ray? 
Every single car.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:43.32,00:08:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jesus. Jesus, Jesus, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:45.39,00:08:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- The car just stopped, and... 
- You're okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:08:47.49,00:08:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you okay? You all right? 
- The lightning started to hit.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:50.40,00:08:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- And me and this other guy... 
- Where the hell did you go?
Dialogue: 0,00:08:52.66,00:08:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Over on Lincoln Avenue. 
- Lincoln Avenue?
Dialogue: 0,00:08:55.37,00:08:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- By the church. 
- You saw the lightning?
Dialogue: 0,00:08:56.94,00:08:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, 26 times we counted, 
over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:59.34,00:09:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The lightning started to hit. 
It opened up this hole or something...
Dialogue: 0,00:09:02.34,00:09:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- Twenty-six times? 
- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:05.28,00:09:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're okay? 
- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:06.81,00:09:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. All right, well, 
your sister is in the house,
Dialogue: 0,00:09:09.11,00:09:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and I want you to go in that house 
and I want you to stay with her, okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:09:12.55,00:09:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The next time you take my car with 
no driver's license and no permission,
Dialogue: 0,00:09:16.56,00:09:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I call the cops.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:20.19,00:09:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You better be there when I get back.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:23.19,00:09:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah. 
- Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:30.14,00:09:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Manny, Manny. 
Manny, what is it, dead?
Dialogue: 0,00:09:33.51,00:09:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them. Everything. 
Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:36.37,00:09:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- The starter's fried. 
- Lightning hit it?
Dialogue: 0,00:09:38.64,00:09:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even close. 
I thought if I changed it...
Dialogue: 0,00:09:41.11,00:09:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Any idea what's going on? 
- I'm on my way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:43.68,00:09:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Try changing the solenoid. 
It's probably fried.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:45.92,00:09:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, that's what I said. 
I told you that. The solenoid.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:49.05,00:09:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, they're saying all the 
lightning struck down by the church.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:04.00,00:10:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on 
around here?
Dialogue: 0,00:10:08.27,00:10:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let us through. 
- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:09.64,00:10:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let us through here. 
- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:18.45,00:10:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I never seen anything like this before.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:20.19,00:10:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That many strikes of lightning 
in one spot?
Dialogue: 0,00:10:22.62,00:10:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is this the only place? 
- Come on, put that down.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:24.66,00:10:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- You wanna step back, please? 
- Step back.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:26.96,00:10:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're gonna fall in. 
- Get back.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:31.30,00:10:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Back up, people. 
People, back up back there.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:35.67,00:10:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Move back. Everybody back up.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:38.80,00:10:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Move back.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:40.84,00:10:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Move back.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:46.11,00:10:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is it hot? 
- Back up.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:47.61,00:10:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- No. 
- Back up.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:49.51,00:10:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's freezing. 
- What is that?
Dialogue: 0,00:10:51.85,00:10:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait. Move. You feel that?
Dialogue: 0,00:10:53.62,00:10:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- I feel that. 
- Hey, Bobby, come check this out.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:57.32,00:10:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- You feel that? 
- Feel that?
Dialogue: 0,00:10:58.79,00:11:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, I feel that. 
- What is it, the subway?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:00.66,00:11:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's no subway here. 
- F train, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:02.96,00:11:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be the water main.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:04.46,00:11:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else down there.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:05.96,00:11:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Water main doesn't run through here. 
- Feel that?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:07.80,00:11:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something down there 
and it's moving.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:14.67,00:11:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody move back.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:17.34,00:11:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa. Back it up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:20.15,00:11:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:22.31,00:11:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, folks. Back up. 
Get back.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:32.66,00:11:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me out here. Get back.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:40.40,00:11:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Go! Move! 
- Everybody get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,00:11:42.33,00:11:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone back up! 
Everyone clear the intersection!
Dialogue: 0,00:11:45.34,00:11:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way! Back up! 
Back up! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,00:12:06.36,00:12:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Forget it! Get back! 
- Get the hell out of the street!
Dialogue: 0,00:12:21.81,00:12:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Move away!
Dialogue: 0,00:12:24.71,00:12:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we gotta 
clear this area now!
Dialogue: 0,00:13:17.93,00:13:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my car!
Dialogue: 0,00:13:21.93,00:13:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:23.50,00:13:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,00:13:49.79,00:13:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,00:13:52.63,00:13:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, people! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,00:13:53.06,00:13:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, back up!
Dialogue: 0,00:13:55.93,00:13:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Move back!
Dialogue: 0,00:15:20.85,00:15:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,00:15:24.82,00:15:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:28.23,00:15:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray, no. Stay, man.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:39.40,00:15:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:41.51,00:15:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just stay back here. Stay back! 
- Wow.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:01.03,00:16:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:36.25,00:17:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's a fire.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:38.86,00:17:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- See? That looks like smoke to me. 
- What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,00:17:42.13,00:17:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you now. 
We've only got about another minute.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:52.54,00:17:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:54.47,00:17:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:02.08,00:18:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just keep it down. 
- Ray, I'm standing right beside you.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:04.42,00:18:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you please answer me?
Dialogue: 0,00:18:08.22,00:18:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get in the front seat, Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:15.49,00:18:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Whose car is this? 
- Just get in.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:17.10,00:18:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose car is this?
Dialogue: 0,00:18:21.60,00:18:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey, Ray. 
You were absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:21.63,00:18:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey, Ray. 
You were absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:24.27,00:18:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That is exact... 
I had to change the solen...
Dialogue: 0,00:18:27.94,00:18:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:30.01,00:18:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ray? Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:31.31,00:18:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, get out of the truck. I'm not 
kidding now. Get out of the car, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:32.34,00:18:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna get in. 
I'm not getting in.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:34.35,00:18:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Manny, get in with us. 
- I'm not gonna get in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:37.12,00:18:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Look, I'm not fooling around... 
- Close the door, Robbie. Close it.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:41.25,00:18:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray, bring the car back, Ray. 
It's not my car.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:46.46,00:18:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down! 
Get down, get down! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,00:18:48.19,00:18:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just get down. Get down! Get down! 
- Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,00:19:23.86,00:19:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna know everything you know.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:26.86,00:19:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,00:19:28.33,00:19:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This machine, 
it crawled out of the ground,
Dialogue: 0,00:19:30.30,00:19:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,started torching everything. 
It was killing everybody.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:44.28,00:19:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That machine,
Dialogue: 0,00:19:46.02,00:19:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,it was already buried.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:49.82,00:19:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it...
Dialogue: 0,00:19:52.02,00:19:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...it came down in the lightning storm.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:55.99,00:19:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- They came down in a lightning storm. 
- What do you mean, came down?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:00.06,00:20:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- You said it was buried. 
- No, the machine I'm talking about
Dialogue: 0,00:20:02.73,00:20:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,was buried, but what 
came down in the lightning storm,
Dialogue: 0,00:20:06.57,00:20:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,what operates it,
Dialogue: 0,00:20:08.47,00:20:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,that's the... You know.
Dialogue: 0,00:20:11.28,00:20:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- The what? 
- That's...
Dialogue: 0,00:20:12.64,00:20:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't there any helicopters 
or airplanes?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:30.03,00:20:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie, get the door.
Dialogue: 0,00:20:33.86,00:20:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,00:20:35.70,00:20:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mom! 
- Mom!
Dialogue: 0,00:20:37.37,00:20:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,00:20:39.87,00:20:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom? Tim?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:45.04,00:20:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom? Tim?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:50.82,00:20:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mom? 
- Mom?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:52.62,00:20:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tim?! 
- Tim?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:56.92,00:20:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tim?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:59.56,00:21:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:02.83,00:21:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:04.40,00:21:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she dead?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:06.46,00:21:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not dead. All right?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:08.57,00:21:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just not here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:10.07,00:21:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- They were never here. 
- How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:12.80,00:21:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they're 
on their way to Boston.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:15.14,00:21:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And so they just...
Dialogue: 0,00:21:17.24,00:21:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...kept on going up to Boston. 
Probably at your grandma's house.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:18.41,00:21:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...kept on going up to Boston. 
Probably at your grandma's house.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:20.65,00:21:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If everything's fine, why do we 
have to sleep in the basement?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:23.31,00:21:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- We've got perfectly good beds. 
- Hey, it's like a slumber party.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:26.65,00:21:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you afraid 
is gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:28.32,00:21:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice basement.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:29.92,00:21:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna sleep in my bed. 
Got back problems.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:49.03,00:22:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the lightning back?
Dialogue: 0,00:23:05.88,00:23:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's that sound? 
- I've never heard that before!
Dialogue: 0,00:23:08.65,00:23:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it them? Is it them?
Dialogue: 0,00:23:12.02,00:23:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:13.32,00:23:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do we go?! 
Robbie, this is your house.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:15.26,00:23:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do we go?!
Dialogue: 0,00:25:29.36,00:25:30.100,Default,,0,0,0,,Down here.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:35.37,00:25:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you on this plane?
Dialogue: 0,00:25:38.54,00:25:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you...? 
Are you a passenger?
Dialogue: 0,00:25:47.71,00:25:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How you doing? 
Wanna help me open this?
Dialogue: 0,00:25:53.12,00:25:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a passenger?
Dialogue: 0,00:25:55.09,00:25:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's deaf.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:56.92,00:26:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The shell went off right beside him. 
Camera on his shoulder saved his life.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:00.72,00:26:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that, Max?
Dialogue: 0,00:26:02.26,00:26:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stupid camera 
saved your stupid life.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:05.73,00:26:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,00:26:08.07,00:26:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Out there in the Pine Barrens.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:10.83,00:26:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We were attached to 
a National Guard unit.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:12.90,00:26:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The 83rd Mechanized.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:14.51,00:26:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They moved on one of those things 
around midnight.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:16.91,00:26:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They got some kind of shield 
around them.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:18.64,00:26:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't see it, but everything we fire 
at them detonates too early,
Dialogue: 0,00:26:21.58,00:26:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,before we can get close enough 
to cause any damage.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:24.92,00:26:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,When they flash that thing, 
everything lights up like Hiroshima.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:29.39,00:26:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more than one?
Dialogue: 0,00:26:32.66,00:26:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me, right?
Dialogue: 0,00:26:35.79,00:26:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We were feeding New York, 
but New York went dark.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:38.10,00:26:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So we patched over to D.C., 
they went down.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:40.63,00:26:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,L.A., Chicago, uplinked to London.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:42.03,00:26:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,L.A., Chicago, uplinked to London.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:43.57,00:26:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Even called the affiliates to try 
to get them to catch the feed,
Dialogue: 0,00:26:46.90,00:26:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but nobody answers. 
It's the same everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:49.74,00:26:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the Tripods start to move, 
no more news comes out of that area.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:06.49,00:27:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,00:27:08.59,00:27:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:14.43,00:27:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in, get in, get in, get in.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:17.77,00:27:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, were you on that plane?
Dialogue: 0,00:27:22.61,00:27:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too bad. 
It would've been a really great story.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:27.85,00:27:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing good. You're doing good. 
Keep your eyes on me.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:30.91,00:27:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going right to Boston.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:32.28,00:27:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're gonna see your mom. 
- I'm not gonna look, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:34.65,00:27:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a girl. That's my girl. 
Now listen.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:36.85,00:27:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- I want you to close your eyes, okay? 
- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:38.79,00:27:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Got them closed? There you go.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:41.33,00:27:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Keep them closed for me. 
- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:48.87,00:27:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie, get in.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:53.04,00:27:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:15.86,00:28:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why aren't we on the turnpike? 
- I don't want everybody
Dialogue: 0,00:28:18.20,00:28:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,to see that we've got a working car. 
We'll stay along the Hudson
Dialogue: 0,00:28:20.86,00:28:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,till we find an open bridge or ferry, 
then we're gonna cross the Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:24.37,00:28:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take the back roads across 
Connecticut, all the way to Boston.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:48.99,00:28:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll close my eyes. 
Why don't you drive for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:52.76,00:28:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a license.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:55.93,00:28:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when has that stopped you?
Dialogue: 0,00:29:28.93,00:29:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:32.64,00:29:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,00:29:33.97,00:29:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,00:29:37.74,00:29:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you could...?
Dialogue: 0,00:29:40.18,00:29:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you could...? 
Do you think you could...?
Dialogue: 0,00:29:43.75,00:29:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:45.32,00:29:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take your foot off. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:29:47.58,00:29:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it, but keep your foot on. 
Okay, I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:50.32,00:29:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where is everybody going? 
- I don't know, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:53.72,00:29:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But we do, right?
Dialogue: 0,00:29:55.89,00:29:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we do.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:11.98,00:30:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Be careful. 
- How'd you fix this?
Dialogue: 0,00:30:14.04,00:30:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- How'd you fix the car? 
- Please! Why won't you help us?
Dialogue: 0,00:30:19.48,00:30:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I can't. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:21.49,00:30:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, get away from the car.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:23.15,00:30:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:25.42,00:30:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop the car! 
- Get off the car!
Dialogue: 0,00:30:29.03,00:30:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You could carry 20 people in there!
Dialogue: 0,00:30:31.33,00:30:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop the car! 
- Get off the car!
Dialogue: 0,00:30:33.56,00:30:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,00:30:49.11,00:30:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:31:03.79,00:31:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:05.76,00:31:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Just wait! Okay! Wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:08.50,00:31:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just stop! 
- Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:10.57,00:31:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:12.74,00:31:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:15.84,00:31:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:25.02,00:31:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:27.05,00:31:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ray! 
- Get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:34.52,00:31:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help! 
- Rachel! Get out of the car!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:37.39,00:31:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel, get... 
Get out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:39.60,00:31:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Get out! 
- Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:49.41,00:31:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Take it easy! 
- Get off the car!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:51.71,00:31:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:53.28,00:31:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off the car! Move!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:54.95,00:31:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:56.88,00:31:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where's my son? 
- You don't need that, man.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:58.88,00:32:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where's my son? Robbie! 
- Cool down, man.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:01.59,00:32:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Put the gun down, man. 
- Robbie!
Dialogue: 0,00:32:10.29,00:32:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now, listen.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:12.16,00:32:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Put down the gun. I'm taking the car. 
- My daughter's in the car.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:15.33,00:32:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm taking the car, man. 
- Please. All I want...
Dialogue: 0,00:32:17.53,00:32:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- Put down the goddamn gun! 
- All I want is my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:20.34,00:32:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm taking the car, man. 
- Please, I just want my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:22.91,00:32:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me just take my daughter. 
Can I...?
Dialogue: 0,00:32:25.08,00:32:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- All I want is my daughter. 
- Yeah. Okay, go ahead, man.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:28.81,00:32:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:40.26,00:32:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,00:33:44.15,00:33:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen this girl? 
This is my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:46.26,00:33:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs his medicine.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:59.90,00:34:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got it the worst, 
that's what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:01.10,00:34:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The U.S., mostly. 
South America and Asia, some.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:05.18,00:34:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing going on in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:07.01,00:34:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Europe got the worst of it, 
that's what everybody's saying.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:09.85,00:34:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Completely wiped out some of it. 
- I don't give a shit who it is.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:12.35,00:34:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I got up close to one of those things 
in Stanfordville.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:14.92,00:34:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're all over the place, 
we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:16.72,00:34:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Looks like the power's still on here. 
- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:19.69,00:34:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, power's still on.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:21.93,00:34:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Because nothing bad's come up 
from the ground.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:25.26,00:34:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hold on. Hold on, move back! 
- Watch out there, lady!
Dialogue: 0,00:34:28.77,00:34:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, move back!
Dialogue: 0,00:35:07.20,00:35:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you are O-positive 
and RH-negative,
Dialogue: 0,00:35:10.57,00:35:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you very much, but we already 
have more blood than we can use.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:14.91,00:35:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Again, if you are O-positive, 
RH-negative, identify yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:21.82,00:35:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are not, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:24.09,00:35:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We already have more blood 
than we can use for the transfusions.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:27.36,00:35:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, folks.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:29.39,00:35:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This way. This way. 
Keep it moving.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:32.50,00:35:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it moving. This way. 
Let's go, folks. Keep it moving.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:36.73,00:35:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please move forward calmly. 
The boat can make more than one trip.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:40.90,00:35:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please move forward calmly. 
Take your time. Don't rush.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:45.38,00:35:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray! Ray! Ray!
Dialogue: 0,00:35:47.84,00:35:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sheryl? 
- Yeah. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:50.41,00:35:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my gosh, is this your...?
Dialogue: 0,00:35:52.35,00:35:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are these your kids? 
- Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:53.72,00:35:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Sheryl. 
This is my daughter, Nora.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:56.45,00:35:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nora. I've heard about you, Nora. 
- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:58.86,00:36:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- This is my son, Robbie. 
- Just like Dad.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:16.91,00:36:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's good to see you as well. 
- Trees are funny.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:20.21,00:36:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna move a few cars out 
of the way to make some more space.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:25.42,00:36:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to give us 
a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:27.72,00:36:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, 
there'll be plenty of room for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:31.05,00:36:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We got sick people here. 
Let us on.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:09.29,00:37:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cast off. Get that ramp up.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:11.100,00:37:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Cast off now. Get that ramp up.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:15.17,00:37:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Cast off.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:16.53,00:37:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No more people. No more people. 
We're taking the ramp up.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:45.06,00:37:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay close. Stay close.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:48.60,00:37:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody stop. Everybody stop.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:51.43,00:37:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait, wait, wait. Just... 
- Back up. Back up.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:55.14,00:37:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's room. 
- Just stay back.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:56.47,00:37:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No more room. 
There's no more room.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:58.14,00:37:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just listen to me. 
There's three of us.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:59.81,00:38:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Five. There's only five of us. 
- There's no room.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:02.28,00:38:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, man, just don't push me.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:03.75,00:38:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sir, there's no more room. 
- There's plenty of room.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:06.18,00:38:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's room for hundreds more. 
- Sir...
Dialogue: 0,00:38:08.65,00:38:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Everybody, wait. 
- Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:09.12,00:38:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- You just stay with me. 
- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:11.55,00:38:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab my jacket.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:12.76,00:38:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody back up.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:14.46,00:38:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Back up.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:15.69,00:38:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you, Ferrier.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:17.33,00:38:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, Jesus. 
- You okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:38:19.33,00:38:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah. 
- Come on.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:20.56,00:38:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay, Jesus. Oh, my God. 
- Come on.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:23.10,00:38:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:32.01,00:38:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:34.51,00:38:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:36.35,00:38:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,00:38:39.18,00:38:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:42.82,00:38:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Go. I can go with him.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:45.02,00:38:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheryl?
Dialogue: 0,00:38:46.86,00:38:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Go with them. Go.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:49.13,00:38:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ray. 
- Sheryl?
Dialogue: 0,00:38:50.33,00:38:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Everybody... 
- Sheryl?
Dialogue: 0,00:38:52.16,00:38:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's room on the boat. 
- Let us through, goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:55.17,00:38:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's still room on the boat. 
- She's a child.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:57.37,00:38:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- Robbie. 
- There's room on the...
Dialogue: 0,00:38:58.94,00:39:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still room on the boat. 
There's room on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:07.18,00:39:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Robbie. 
- Just stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:09.05,00:39:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with me, Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:31.50,00:39:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:52.82,00:39:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie!
Dialogue: 0,00:40:38.13,00:40:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Swim. Swim this way!
Dialogue: 0,00:41:33.72,00:41:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Robbie, help me with her. 
- Here, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:39.53,00:41:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop. Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:42.67,00:41:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:01.15,00:42:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:08.75,00:43:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:10.59,00:43:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move. Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:12.59,00:43:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for God's sake, stay right here. 
I'm coming right back.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:15.59,00:43:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Robbie! 
- Stop those people.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:17.76,00:43:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Turn around. Turn around. 
- Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:20.46,00:43:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:22.03,00:43:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:23.43,00:43:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,00:43:24.80,00:43:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,00:43:30.14,00:43:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull back. 
Five hundred meters to my 10 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:35.61,00:43:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Jekyll, no effect on target. 
No effect.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:37.98,00:43:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger. No effect.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:39.38,00:43:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mission, lieutenant, 
is to delay their advance
Dialogue: 0,00:43:42.32,00:43:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,till those refugees get to safety. 
Now, keep firing.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:47.26,00:43:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotta listen. Turn around! 
I want you to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:53.16,00:43:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:54.36,00:43:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back down the hill!
Dialogue: 0,00:43:56.13,00:43:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, just turn around!
Dialogue: 0,00:44:12.48,00:44:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here 
all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,00:44:13.02,00:44:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here 
all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,00:44:14.38,00:44:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweetie, you gotta come with us, 
please.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:16.25,00:44:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- My dad's right there. 
- Please, come.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:17.75,00:44:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please, my dad's right there. 
- Listen to me...
Dialogue: 0,00:44:19.69,00:44:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to be here. I want to see this.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:22.63,00:44:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. Wait... Just stay for Rachel. 
Stay for your sister.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:25.23,00:44:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let me go. 
You need to let me go.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:32.24,00:44:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:33.47,00:44:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're coming with us. 
- Dad.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:34.90,00:44:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're going now. 
- I can't.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:36.97,00:44:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,00:44:42.31,00:44:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:44.75,00:44:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,00:44:51.72,00:44:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,00:44:56.83,00:44:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Guide on. Guide on.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:58.09,00:44:59.100,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Six. Attack. Attack. Attack.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:02.57,00:45:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:04.37,00:45:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's my dad. 
- I'm her father. I'm her father.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:07.37,00:45:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're so sorry. 
- We thought she was alone.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:09.54,00:45:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- She was standing by the tree... 
- She's fine. Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,00:45:16.25,00:45:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:27.72,00:45:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie!
Dialogue: 0,00:45:48.38,00:45:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:49.95,00:45:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,00:45:54.98,00:45:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:16.37,00:46:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:18.17,00:46:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:21.68,00:46:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:37.49,00:46:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:40.86,00:46:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that comfortable?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:44.80,00:46:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to close 
your eyes now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:47.64,00:46:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You need some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:51.71,00:46:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:53.38,00:46:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna meet us.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:56.21,00:46:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Robbie's gonna meet us, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:58.65,00:47:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,In Boston, at your grandma's.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:01.18,00:47:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think 
Mom's doing right this minute?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:04.52,00:47:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:07.12,00:47:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Boston. She's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:09.63,00:47:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know she's not sleeping, 
because she is so worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:13.33,00:47:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And she's in Grandma's kitchen,
Dialogue: 0,00:47:15.06,00:47:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and she's...
Dialogue: 0,00:47:18.33,00:47:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She's making that awful tea 
she makes.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:21.40,00:47:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're all just...
Dialogue: 0,00:47:23.97,00:47:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all just counting the minutes 
until they see you again.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:29.51,00:47:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:31.11,00:47:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:33.08,00:47:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I won.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:34.42,00:47:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You won?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:35.89,00:47:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The walk, trot and canter.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:38.32,00:47:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Third place.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:47.83,00:47:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach schnapps.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:49.67,00:47:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Disgusting, I know it.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:51.43,00:47:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Found a whole case of this shit.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:00.41,00:48:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:07.28,00:48:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about your son.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:09.59,00:48:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We got separated. He's...
Dialogue: 0,00:48:11.35,00:48:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna meet us in Boston.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:21.06,00:48:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you...?
Dialogue: 0,00:48:24.53,00:48:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you lose anybody?
Dialogue: 0,00:48:28.80,00:48:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:33.41,00:48:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Harlan Ogilvy.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:36.91,00:48:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray Ferrier.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:38.51,00:48:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I got water.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:41.42,00:48:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Food enough for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:44.45,00:48:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to stay. Both of youse.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:47.39,00:48:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:50.13,00:48:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:53.93,00:48:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Those machines, those...
Dialogue: 0,00:48:56.73,00:48:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...Tripods they got?
Dialogue: 0,00:49:01.10,00:49:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They buried them.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:03.94,00:49:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right under our feet.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:07.18,00:49:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Since before there...
Dialogue: 0,00:49:09.58,00:49:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There were even people here.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:12.58,00:49:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been planning this 
for a million years.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:17.35,00:49:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We're beat to shit.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:19.09,00:49:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:20.42,00:49:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- My daughter... 
- Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:25.80,00:49:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They defeated the greatest power 
in the world in a couple days.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:29.43,00:49:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Walked right over us.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:31.83,00:49:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And these are only the first. 
They'll keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:36.11,00:49:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a war
Dialogue: 0,00:49:37.64,00:49:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,any more than there's 
a war between men and maggots.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:41.01,00:49:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an extermination.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:53.82,00:49:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,00:49:57.33,00:49:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:01.66,00:50:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I been around death plenty.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:05.17,00:50:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I drive an ambulance in the city...
Dialogue: 0,00:50:07.04,00:50:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Drove an ambulance in the city.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:09.67,00:50:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all over now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,00:50:15.08,00:50:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the people 
that make it, Ray?
Dialogue: 0,00:50:18.38,00:50:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones that don't flatline 
before the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,00:50:24.22,00:50:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the ones 
that keep their eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:27.92,00:50:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That keep looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:29.43,00:50:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep thinking.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:31.23,00:50:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the ones that survive.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:35.23,00:50:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't lose our heads, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:39.50,00:50:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Running.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:41.67,00:50:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:45.24,00:50:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm dead set on living.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:53.22,00:50:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead set on living...
Dialogue: 0,00:50:58.15,00:51:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking us in.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:07.46,00:51:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not gonna be exterminated.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:25.51,00:51:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:27.42,00:51:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna show you something.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:30.05,00:51:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna fight them, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:31.75,00:51:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They gotta have a weakness.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:33.12,00:51:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:42.60,00:51:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow they killed 
a few of these things in Osaka.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:45.13,00:51:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:46.34,00:51:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You telling me the Japanese 
can figure it out, but we can't?
Dialogue: 0,00:51:48.94,00:51:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do this, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:50.57,00:51:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do it. We can get them.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:52.54,00:51:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We can figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:54.94,00:51:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:16.07,00:52:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:18.03,00:52:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you bring us here?
Dialogue: 0,00:52:19.64,00:52:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,To fight them together, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:22.57,00:52:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we'll be the ones coming up 
from underground.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:27.54,00:52:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When the time is right...
Dialogue: 0,00:52:29.55,00:52:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,...take them by surprise, 
the way they took us.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:32.92,00:52:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:36.25,00:52:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right under their feet, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:37.79,00:52:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here. Under their feet.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:29.24,00:53:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You miss your mommy?
Dialogue: 0,00:53:31.91,00:53:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:34.74,00:53:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nearly your age.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:37.38,00:53:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, if anything happens 
to your daddy,
Dialogue: 0,00:53:40.08,00:53:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:41.88,00:53:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:51.39,00:53:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have 
anything to say to her.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:53.60,00:53:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,00:53:55.86,00:53:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanna talk to somebody,
Dialogue: 0,00:53:57.70,00:53:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,if you wanna ask a question, 
you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:59.44,00:54:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly is your plan, Ray?
Dialogue: 0,00:54:02.10,00:54:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm gonna do. 
How about you?
Dialogue: 0,00:54:05.24,00:54:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna sit here? 
Wait for them to come get you?
Dialogue: 0,00:54:08.54,00:54:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that your plan?
Dialogue: 0,00:54:11.11,00:54:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you wanna get caught.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:14.62,00:54:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Couple days hiding in a basement 
too much for you, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:18.35,00:54:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll probably turn yourself right in.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:24.13,00:54:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:26.80,00:54:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It stopped.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:28.30,00:54:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:29.80,00:54:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'll get lucky, 
and they'll train you as their pet.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:32.77,00:54:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, feed you, 
train you how to do tricks.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:33.26,00:56:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>No.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:56:37.09,00:56:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>No. No.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:56:40.10,00:56:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:39.33,01:01:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray. Ray.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:42.16,01:01:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray. Ray. Ray!
Dialogue: 0,01:01:45.07,01:01:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,01:01:46.80,01:01:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down. Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,01:02:31.08,01:02:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my blood. Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:36.75,01:02:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:39.65,01:02:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my...
Dialogue: 0,01:02:42.06,01:02:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not...
Dialogue: 0,01:02:44.63,01:02:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...my...
Dialogue: 0,01:02:48.23,01:02:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:50.80,01:02:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:52.40,01:02:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:54.14,01:02:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:55.97,01:02:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:57.57,01:02:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- Not my blood. 
- Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:59.31,01:03:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop it. 
- Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:01.04,01:03:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop it. 
- Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:02.44,01:03:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:04.15,01:03:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- You want them to hear you? 
- They drink us.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:06.21,01:03:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please, they'll hear you. 
- They drink us.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:08.28,01:03:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they spray us, like fertilizer.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:11.35,01:03:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:12.82,01:03:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Drink us, and... 
- They're gonna come back down here.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:15.76,01:03:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they spit us out all over 
the goddamn red weeds.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:18.93,01:03:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand 
what I'm gonna have to do?
Dialogue: 0,01:03:20.93,01:03:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let my daughter die 
because of you.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:22.83,01:03:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This tunnel will get us to the city.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:24.97,01:03:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have tunnels there. 
Ready-made.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:26.84,01:03:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop it. 
- Subway. See what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,01:03:28.60,01:03:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hide an army down there. 
- Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:30.11,01:03:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go underground. 
Sneak attacks at night.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:31.84,01:03:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You stop it!
Dialogue: 0,01:03:35.24,01:03:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the resistance, Ray. 
They can't occupy this country.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:38.51,01:03:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Occupations always fail. History's 
taught us that a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:42.12,01:03:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our land.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:44.62,01:03:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We eat it, we breathe it, 
only we can live on it.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:47.99,01:03:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't survive here, Ray. 
They weren't built for it.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:51.99,01:03:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill you, brother, 
not me!
Dialogue: 0,01:03:54.33,01:03:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing, Dad? 
- Not my blood!
Dialogue: 0,01:03:56.97,01:03:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you hear, 
don't take this off.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:00.30,01:04:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dad? 
- Rach?
Dialogue: 0,01:04:01.97,01:04:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dad? 
- What was that song?
Dialogue: 0,01:04:04.51,01:04:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- That lullaby that I didn't know? 
- Not my blood!
Dialogue: 0,01:04:08.24,01:04:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- "Hushabye Mountain"? 
- Yeah, sing it.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:10.25,01:04:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- They can take you! 
- Please, Rach, sing it.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:13.22,01:04:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>- They can take you! 
- A gentle breeze</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:04:16.59,01:04:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Your daughter! 
- Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:18.35,01:04:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>- Not me! 
- On Hushabye Mountain</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:04:21.02,01:04:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- They're gonna kill you! 
- That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:22.82,01:04:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Softly blows over Lullaby Bay</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:04:27.90,01:04:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>- Forget it! Tunnel! 
- It fills the sails</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:04:33.17,01:04:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Of boats that are waiting</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:04:37.51,01:04:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Waiting to sail 
Your worries away</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:06:32.52,01:06:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:06:34.62,01:06:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:06:36.93,01:06:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, no.
Dialogue: 0,01:06:42.33,01:06:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:06:43.13,01:06:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel? Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:06:56.85,01:06:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel? Make some noise, baby.
Dialogue: 0,01:06:59.61,01:07:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:07:02.42,01:07:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:07:08.69,01:07:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel? Talk to me, baby. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,01:07:15.20,01:07:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:07:19.90,01:07:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:07:35.68,01:07:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:07:37.75,01:07:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,01:08:46.32,01:08:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,01:08:48.59,01:08:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,01:09:20.82,01:09:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,01:09:59.09,01:10:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,01:10:04.50,01:10:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,01:10:37.40,01:10:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:39.33,01:10:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel. Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:42.94,01:10:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:46.07,01:10:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:10:49.14,01:10:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:51.81,01:10:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,01:11:20.11,01:11:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,01:11:22.78,01:11:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull me! Pull me!
Dialogue: 0,01:11:32.12,01:11:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull! Pull!
Dialogue: 0,01:11:34.79,01:11:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull me! Come on, pull!
Dialogue: 0,01:11:40.70,01:11:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dad! 
- One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,01:11:43.36,01:11:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We got him! Keep pulling!
Dialogue: 0,01:11:53.88,01:11:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody down!
Dialogue: 0,01:12:48.100,01:12:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it moving, folks.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:53.57,01:12:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going, sir. Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:56.17,01:12:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:00.54,01:13:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold Grandma's hand.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:04.55,01:13:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, folks. 
Keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:18.26,01:13:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Put that down.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:22.53,01:13:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Right this way, ma'am. 
Right this way, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:33.47,01:13:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left, there, ma'am, 
just to your left. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:38.55,01:13:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to it?
Dialogue: 0,01:13:44.72,01:13:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dying.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:48.72,01:13:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:00.90,01:14:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving, it's all right!
Dialogue: 0,01:14:02.50,01:14:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can pass on through. 
Move along!
Dialogue: 0,01:14:04.41,01:14:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- What happened here? 
- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:05.91,01:14:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's happening to them. 
Please, keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:07.98,01:14:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's go, move out. 
- Let's go, people.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:09.68,01:14:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Something's happening to them? 
- Go. Go, just keep moving, sir.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:12.98,01:14:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, sir. Let's go. Do not stop. 
Keep moving. Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:15.75,01:14:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. What's happened here? 
Did you guys take it down?
Dialogue: 0,01:14:18.12,01:14:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No, sir, it was behaving erratically, 
walking in circles,
Dialogue: 0,01:14:20.49,01:14:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,then it went down on its own 
about an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:22.52,01:14:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, please, let's go! Let's go! 
Keep moving! Come on! Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,01:14:25.49,01:14:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not stop! Let's go! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,01:14:29.06,01:14:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it dead all by itself?
Dialogue: 0,01:14:31.13,01:14:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Rachel, I'm not sure. 
- Coming through.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:33.84,01:14:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming through. Make a hole. 
Coming through.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:56.86,01:14:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down. 
Calm down and get in the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:59.29,01:15:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down and get in the tunnel. 
Calm down and get in the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,01:15:16.88,01:15:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's safer in here.
Dialogue: 0,01:15:18.25,01:15:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,01:15:20.31,01:15:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring out the Javelin!
Dialogue: 0,01:15:30.42,01:15:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear! Get from behind! Clear!
Dialogue: 0,01:15:41.94,01:15:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let me know when you're tracking! 
- Tracking!
Dialogue: 0,01:15:44.51,01:15:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- You got a lock? 
- I got a lock!
Dialogue: 0,01:15:46.27,01:15:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire the Javelin!
Dialogue: 0,01:15:54.75,01:15:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- I got a lock! 
- Fire the Javelin!
Dialogue: 0,01:16:00.29,01:16:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,01:16:16.14,01:16:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,01:16:19.11,01:16:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,01:16:21.18,01:16:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's okay. You're gonna be okay. 
- Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,01:16:25.21,01:16:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep those civilians out of there.
Dialogue: 0,01:16:27.52,01:16:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Back. Stay back! 
Come on, folks, back up!
Dialogue: 0,01:16:36.39,01:16:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, get on the line. 
Get up there now.
